38629>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down.
38629>>>                Case Break
38630>>>
38630>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
38633>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
38633>>>                Case Break
38634>>>
38634>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38634>>>
38634>>>        Case End
38634>>>
38634>>>        Send SetActionButtons
